      "artist": "Mhmd.fahrezzy",
      "description": "Rafflesia Arnoldii or carrion flower is an existing tourism icon in Bengkulu Province, this flower grows in the rain forests of Sumatra and Kalimantan. This interest is included in the Rare Interest According to Presidential Decree number 4 of 1993. ( WIKIPEDIA.)",
      "dateCreated": "2019-05-31 09:52:29",
      "sourceType": "commons-category",
      "sourceArticleId": "barisan-mountains-wp",
